flowchart TD
  A[Accept actual parked hull and manifest] --> R[Existing Approaching Dispatch route owner]
  R --> C{Cancel before departure?}
  C -->|Yes| I[Withdraw own future commitments once; cancel_released]
  I --> K[Keep captured approach route / deadline / physical state]
  K --> B[Existing timed arrival at real Dispatch berth]
  B --> H[Existing cancel_after_route handoff to Cancelling]
  H --> U[Existing physical passenger/cargo unloading]
  U --> P[Existing return route to reserved home slot]
  P --> F[Park same hull and crew; release lane / manifest]
  F --> N[Later real same-hull shipment can be accepted]
  I --> G[Reject repeat cancel and mode / route / gun edits]
  C -->|No| L[Normal physical staging and loading]
  L --> D[Actual departure: predeparture cancel rejects]
  K --> X[Existing fuel / damage / blocked-route failure retains custody]
